{"id":"n54462-1-7","stage":5,"title":"따갑다 · 灼热","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n54462-1-7-1","ko":"햇살이 따가우니까 모자 꼭 쓰고 다니렴.","zh":"阳光很刺眼，出门时一定要戴帽子哦。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"햇살이","meaning":"阳光，日光","explanation":"햇살：阳光，日光；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"햇살","audio":"/audio/1436beae29371a857708.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72477","senseId":"1","lemma":"햇살","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"따가우니까","meaning":"灼热","explanation":"따갑다：灼热；으니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"따갑다","audio":"/audio/81a7a4326febedd1fe9e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"54462","senseId":"1","lemma":"따갑다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모자","meaning":"帽子","explanation":"모자：帽子","readings":[{"term":"모자","audio":"/audio/4bf2a7500031422684ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69297","senseId":"1","lemma":"모자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓰고","meaning":"戴","explanation":"쓰다：戴；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65173","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다니렴.","meaning":"常去","explanation":"다니다：常去；렴：向亲近的人或晚辈发出指示、劝告或请求。","readings":[{"term":"다니다","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29702","senseId":"1","lemma":"다니다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1436beae29371a85","term":"햇살","zh":"阳光，日光","audio":"/audio/1436beae29371a857708.mp3","entryId":"72477","definition":"太阳发射的光线。","pronunciation":["해쌀","핻쌀"]},{"id":"81a7a4326febedd1","term":"따갑다","zh":"灼热","audio":"/audio/81a7a4326febedd1fe9e.mp3","entryId":"54462","definition":"热得皮肤刺痛。","pronunciation":["따갑따"]},{"id":"4bf2a75000314226","term":"모자","zh":"帽子","audio":"/audio/4bf2a7500031422684ab.mp3","entryId":"69297","definition":"戴在头上以表示礼貌或阻挡严寒暑热等的东西。","pronunciation":["모자"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"一定，必定","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"无论有什么事情也务必。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"戴","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65173","definition":"将帽子或假发等套在头上。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]},{"id":"02309ed22c9c3627","term":"다니다","zh":"常去","audio":"/audio/02309ed22c9c36273e57.mp3","entryId":"29702","definition":"经常出入某个地方。","pronunciation":["다니다"]}],"audio":"/audio/970e3ff055ce71b49a23.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n54462-1-7-2","ko":"네, 잊지 않고 쓸게요.","zh":"好的，我一定不会忘戴的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잊지","meaning":"忘，忘记，忘却","explanation":"잊다：忘，忘记，忘却；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"잊다","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70067","senseId":"1","lemma":"잊다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"않고","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"쓸게요.","meaning":"戴","explanation":"쓰다：戴；ㄹ게요：向对方礼貌地表达自己的决定或承诺。","readings":[{"term":"쓰다","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65173","senseId":"1","lemma":"쓰다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1c0ddfd005093840","term":"네","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3","entryId":"17294","definition":"用于肯定回答长辈所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["네"]},{"id":"b0566314f635fe32","term":"잊다","zh":"忘，忘记，忘却","audio":"/audio/b0566314f635fe32e273.mp3","entryId":"70067","definition":"本来知道的事情记不住或记不起来。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"e5721a077be2e027","term":"쓰다","zh":"戴","audio":"/audio/e5721a077be2e027ff8c.mp3","entryId":"65173","definition":"将帽子或假发等套在头上。","pronunciation":["쓰다"]}],"audio":"/audio/cd5bb1e5f7b53ddbcffd.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.231,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=54462","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":154,"sequenceScore":3.0577,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["阳光很刺眼，出门时一定要戴帽子哦。","好的，我一定不会忘戴的。","我真不知道这到底是件好事还是坏事。"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["阳光很刺眼，出门时一定要戴帽子哦。","好的，我一定不会忘戴的。","我真不知道这到底是件好事还是坏事。"],"answer":1}]}
